.\" Man page for clawdius(1)
.TH CLAWDIUS 1 "2026-05-20" "clawdius 1.0.0-rc.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
clawdius \- High-assurance Rust-native AI coding assistant
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B clawdius
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clawdius is a high-assurance, Rust-native AI coding assistant with
multi-provider LLM support, streaming TUI, shell completions, and
formal verification via Lean4 proofs.
.PP
Supports 9 LLM providers: Anthropic, OpenAI, OpenRouter, Ollama,
Google Gemini, xAI (Grok), Mistral AI, DeepSeek, and Groq.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-no\-tui
Run in headless mode (read from stdin).
.TP
.BR \-C ", " \-\-cwd " " \fIDIR\fR
Set working directory.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-output\-format " " \fIFORMAT\fR
Output format: text, json (default: text).
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Quiet mode (no progress indicators).
.TP
.BR \-\-config " " \fIPATH\fR
Path to config file (defaults to .clawdius/config.toml).
.TP
.BR \-\-lang " " \fILANG\fR
Language setting.
.TP
.BR \-\-generate\-completions " " \fISHELL\fR
Generate shell completions (bash, zsh, fish, powershell) to stdout.
