.SH EXAMPLES
Start the interactive TUI:
.RS
.B clawdius
.RE
.PP
Send a single chat message:
.RS
.B clawdius chat "Explain this function"
.RE
.PP
Generate bash completions:
.RS
.B clawdius --generate-completions bash > /etc/bash_completion.d/clawdius
.RE
.PP
Run in headless mode:
.RS
.B echo "hello" | clawdius --no-tui
.RE
